    "It may be turned off or without internet. Remote keeps trying while this window is open.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It may be turned off or without internet. Remote keeps trying while this window is open."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It may be turned off or without internet. Remote keeps trying while this window is open."
          }
        },
        "en-AU": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It may be turned off or without internet. Remote keeps trying while this window is open."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它可能已关机或没有网络。此窗口打开期间，Remote 会持续尝试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它可能已關機或沒有網路。此視窗開啟期間，Remote 會持續嘗試。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "電源が切れているか、インターネットに接続されていない可能性があります。このウインドウを開いている間、Remote は再試行を続けます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "전원이 꺼져 있거나 인터넷에 연결되어 있지 않을 수 있습니다. 이 윈도우가 열려 있는 동안 Remote가 계속 시도합니다."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puede estar apagado o sin internet. Remote sigue intentándolo mientras esta ventana esté abierta."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il est peut-être éteint ou sans internet. Remote continue d’essayer tant que cette fenêtre est ouverte."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Möglicherweise ist er ausgeschaltet oder ohne Internet. Remote versucht es weiter, solange dieses Fenster geöffnet ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It plays on the connected device: Opus, 48 kHz stereo, about 20 ms behind the picture": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It plays on the connected device: Opus, 48 kHz stereo, about 20 ms behind the picture"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It plays on the connected device: Opus, 48 kHz stereo, about 20 ms behind the picture"
          }
        },
        "en-AU": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It plays on the connected device: Opus, 48 kHz stereo, about 20 ms behind the picture"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在已连接的设备上播放：Opus，48 kHz 立体声，比画面延迟约 20 ms"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在已連線的裝置上播放：Opus，48 kHz 立體聲，比畫面延遲約 20 ms"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接続中のデバイスで再生されます：Opus、48 kHz ステレオ、映像より約 20 ms 遅れます"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "연결된 기기에서 재생됩니다: Opus, 48 kHz 스테레오, 화면보다 약 20 ms 늦음"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se reproduce en el dispositivo conectado: Opus, estéreo a 48 kHz, unos 20 ms por detrás de la imagen"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lu sur l’appareil connecté : Opus, stéréo 48 kHz, environ 20 ms de retard sur l’image"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wird auf dem verbundenen Gerät wiedergegeben: Opus, 48 kHz Stereo, etwa 20 ms hinter dem Bild"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It told this Mac it was going to sleep. Reconnect once it’s awake.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It told this Mac it was going to sleep. Reconnect once it’s awake."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It told this Mac it was going to sleep. Reconnect once it’s awake."
          }
        },
        "en-AU": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It told this Mac it was going to sleep. Reconnect once it’s awake."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它已通知这台 Mac 即将进入睡眠。唤醒后请重新连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它已通知這台 Mac 即將進入睡眠。喚醒後請重新連線。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "スリープに入ることをこの Mac に通知しました。復帰したら再接続してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 Mac에 잠자기 상태로 들어간다고 알렸습니다. 깨어나면 다시 연결하세요."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ha avisado a este Mac de que se iba a suspender. Reconecta cuando se reactive."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il a indiqué à ce Mac qu’il allait se mettre en veille. Reconnectez-vous lorsqu’il sera réveillé."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Er hat diesem Mac mitgeteilt, dass er in den Ruhezustand wechselt. Erneut verbinden, sobald er wieder aktiv ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its apps play to a virtual output, “Remote”, which plays here; nothing is muted": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Its apps play to a virtual output, “Remote”, which plays here; nothing is muted"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Its apps play to a virtual output, “Remote”, which plays here; nothing is muted"
          }
        },
        "en-AU": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Its apps play to a virtual output, “Remote”, which plays here; nothing is muted"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其应用会输出到虚拟输出设备“Remote”，由本机播放；不会静音任何内容"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其 App 會輸出到虛擬輸出裝置「Remote」，由本機播放；不會將任何內容靜音"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "そのコンピューターのアプリは仮想出力「Remote」に再生され、それがこちらで再生されます。ミュートされるものはありません"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "컴퓨터의 앱은 가상 출력 ‘Remote’로 재생되며 이 기기에서 재생됩니다. 음소거되는 항목은 없습니다"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sus aplicaciones reproducen en una salida virtual, «Remote», que suena aquí; no se silencia nada"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ses apps jouent vers une sortie virtuelle « Remote », qui est lue ici ; rien n’est mis en sourdine"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Apps spielen auf einer virtuellen Ausgabe „Remote“ ab, die hier wiedergegeben wird; nichts wird stummgeschaltet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
