    "So ⌘Tab, ⌘Space and other system shortcuts reach the computer while you stream": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "So ⌘Tab, ⌘Space and other system shortcuts reach the computer while you stream"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "So ⌘Tab, ⌘Space and other system shortcuts reach the computer while you stream"
          }
        },
        "en-AU": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "So ⌘Tab, ⌘Space and other system shortcuts reach the computer while you stream"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这样在串流时，⌘Tab、⌘空格键和其他系统快捷键会传到电脑上"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這樣在串流時，⌘Tab、⌘空白鍵和其他系統快速鍵會傳到電腦上"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ストリーミング中、⌘Tab、⌘Space などのシステムのショートカットがコンピューターに届きます"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "스트리밍 중에 ⌘Tab, ⌘Space 등 시스템 단축키가 컴퓨터로 전달됩니다"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Así ⌘Tab, ⌘Espacio y otros atajos del sistema llegan al equipo mientras transmites"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ainsi, ⌘Tab, ⌘Espace et les autres raccourcis système parviennent à l’ordinateur pendant le streaming"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "So erreichen ⌘Tab, ⌘Leertaste und andere Systemkurzbefehle den Computer, solange Sie streamen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sodium Remote doesn’t check for updates. Build the new version of the app (BUILD.md in the source) and install it on both computers. Each release speaks its own protocol version and the one before it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sodium Remote doesn’t check for updates. Build the new version of the app (BUILD.md in the source) and install it on both computers. Each release speaks its own protocol version and the one before it."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sodium Remote doesn’t check for updates. Build the new version of the app (BUILD.md in the source) and install it on both computers. Each release speaks its own protocol version and the one before it."
          }
        },
        "en-AU": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sodium Remote doesn’t check for updates. Build the new version of the app (BUILD.md in the source) and install it on both computers. Each release speaks its own protocol version and the one before it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sodium Remote 不会检查更新。请构建应用的新版本（源代码中的 BUILD.md），并安装到两台电脑上。每个版本支持自己的协议版本以及上一个协议版本。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sodium Remote 不會檢查更新。請建置 App 的新版本（原始碼中的 BUILD.md），並安裝到兩台電腦上。每個版本支援自己的通訊協定版本以及前一個版本。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sodium Remote は更新を確認しません。アプリの新しいバージョンをビルドし（ソースの BUILD.md を参照）、両方のコンピューターにインストールしてください。各リリースは、自身のプロトコルバージョンとその1つ前のバージョンに対応します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sodium Remote는 업데이트를 확인하지 않습니다. 앱의 새 버전을 빌드하고(소스의 BUILD.md 참조) 두 컴퓨터 모두에 설치하세요. 각 릴리스는 자체 프로토콜 버전과 그 이전 버전을 지원합니다."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sodium Remote no busca actualizaciones. Compila la nueva versión de la app (BUILD.md en el código fuente) e instálala en ambos equipos. Cada versión admite su propia versión de protocolo y la anterior."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sodium Remote ne recherche pas de mises à jour. Compilez la nouvelle version de l’app (BUILD.md dans les sources) et installez-la sur les deux ordinateurs. Chaque version prend en charge sa propre version de protocole et la précédente."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sodium Remote sucht nicht nach Updates. Die neue Version der App erstellen (BUILD.md im Quellcode) und auf beiden Computern installieren. Jede Version unterstützt ihre eigene Protokollversion und die vorherige."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sodium Remote streams another computer to this Mac. ⌘ is the computer’s Win key. In full screen every key goes to the computer; ⌘Esc leaves full screen and ⌘⇧Esc disconnects. Remote’s own shortcuts are ⌃⌥⌘ + a key: F full screen, S stats, M the in-stream menu, D disconnect, K release the keyboard, L lock.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sodium Remote streams another computer to this Mac. ⌘ is the computer’s Win key. In full screen every key goes to the computer; ⌘Esc leaves full screen and ⌘⇧Esc disconnects. Remote’s own shortcuts are ⌃⌥⌘ + a key: F full screen, S stats, M the in-stream menu, D disconnect, K release the keyboard, L lock."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sodium Remote streams another computer to this Mac. ⌘ is the computer’s Win key. In full screen every key goes to the computer; ⌘Esc leaves full screen and ⌘⇧Esc disconnects. Remote’s own shortcuts are ⌃⌥⌘ + a key: F full screen, S stats, M the in-stream menu, D disconnect, K release the keyboard, L lock."
          }
        },
        "en-AU": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sodium Remote streams another computer to this Mac. ⌘ is the computer’s Win key. In full screen every key goes to the computer; ⌘Esc leaves full screen and ⌘⇧Esc disconnects. Remote’s own shortcuts are ⌃⌥⌘ + a key: F full screen, S stats, M the in-stream menu, D disconnect, K release the keyboard, L lock."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sodium Remote 会把另一台电脑的画面串流到这台 Mac。⌘ 对应那台电脑的 Win 键。全屏时，所有按键都会发送到那台电脑；⌘Esc 退出全屏，⌘⇧Esc 断开连接。Sodium Remote 自己的快捷键是 ⌃⌥⌘ + 一个键：F 全屏，S 统计，M 串流中菜单，D 断开连接，K 释放键盘，L 锁定。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sodium Remote 會把另一台電腦的畫面串流到這台 Mac。⌘ 對應那台電腦的 Win 鍵。全螢幕時，所有按鍵都會傳送到那台電腦；⌘Esc 結束全螢幕，⌘⇧Esc 中斷連線。Sodium Remote 自己的快速鍵是 ⌃⌥⌘ + 一個按鍵：F 全螢幕，S 統計資料，M 串流中選單，D 中斷連線，K 釋放鍵盤，L 鎖定。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sodium Remote は、別のコンピューターの画面をこの Mac にストリーミングします。⌘ はコンピューターの Win キーに対応します。フルスクリーン中はすべてのキーがコンピューターに送られ、⌘Esc でフルスクリーンを終了、⌘⇧Esc で切断します。Sodium Remote 自身のショートカットは ⌃⌥⌘ + キーです: F フルスクリーン、S 統計、M ストリーム内メニュー、D 切断、K キーボードを解放、L ロック。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sodium Remote는 다른 컴퓨터의 화면을 이 Mac으로 스트리밍합니다. ⌘는 컴퓨터의 Win 키에 해당합니다. 전체 화면에서는 모든 키가 컴퓨터로 전달되며, ⌘Esc는 전체 화면을 종료하고 ⌘⇧Esc는 연결을 끊습니다. Sodium Remote 자체 단축키는 ⌃⌥⌘ + 키입니다: F 전체 화면, S 통계, M 스트림 내 메뉴, D 연결 끊기, K 키보드 해제, L 잠금."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sodium Remote transmite otro equipo a este Mac. ⌘ es la tecla Win del equipo. En pantalla completa, todas las teclas van al equipo; ⌘Esc sale de pantalla completa y ⌘⇧Esc desconecta. Los atajos propios de Sodium Remote son ⌃⌥⌘ + una tecla: F pantalla completa, S estadísticas, M el menú de la transmisión, D desconectar, K liberar el teclado, L bloquear."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sodium Remote diffuse un autre ordinateur sur ce Mac. ⌘ correspond à la touche Win de l’ordinateur. En plein écran, toutes les touches sont envoyées à l’ordinateur ; ⌘Échap quitte le plein écran et ⌘⇧Échap déconnecte. Les raccourcis propres à Sodium Remote sont ⌃⌥⌘ + une touche : F plein écran, S statistiques, M le menu du flux, D déconnecter, K libérer le clavier, L verrouiller."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sodium Remote überträgt einen anderen Computer auf diesen Mac. ⌘ ist die Win-Taste des Computers. Im Vollbild gehen alle Tasten an den Computer; ⌘Esc beendet den Vollbildmodus und ⌘⇧Esc trennt die Verbindung. Die eigenen Kurzbefehle von Sodium Remote sind ⌃⌥⌘ + eine Taste: F Vollbild, S Statistik, M das Menü im Stream, D trennen, K Tastatur freigeben, L sperren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
