    "The latency test clicks the test surface on the computer (spikes/remote-e2e) and times its flip to this screen. Start the test surface there, connect, then run the test.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The latency test clicks the test surface on the computer (spikes/remote-e2e) and times its flip to this screen. Start the test surface there, connect, then run the test."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The latency test clicks the test surface on the computer (spikes/remote-e2e) and times its flip to this screen. Start the test surface there, connect, then run the test."
          }
        },
        "en-AU": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The latency test clicks the test surface on the computer (spikes/remote-e2e) and times its flip to this screen. Start the test surface there, connect, then run the test."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "延迟测试会点击电脑上的测试界面（spikes/remote-e2e），并计时其变化显示到此屏幕所需的时间。请先在那台电脑上启动测试界面，连接后再运行测试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "延遲測試會點按電腦上的測試介面（spikes/remote-e2e），並計時其變化顯示到此螢幕所需的時間。請先在那台電腦上啟動測試介面，連線後再執行測試。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遅延テストは、コンピューター上のテスト画面（spikes/remote-e2e）をクリックし、その表示が切り替わってこの画面に届くまでの時間を計測します。先に相手側でテスト画面を起動し、接続してからテストを実行してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "지연 시간 테스트는 컴퓨터의 테스트 화면(spikes/remote-e2e)을 클릭하고, 그 화면이 바뀌어 이 화면에 표시되기까지의 시간을 측정합니다. 먼저 해당 컴퓨터에서 테스트 화면을 시작하고 연결한 다음 테스트를 실행하세요."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La prueba de latencia hace clic en la superficie de prueba del equipo (spikes/remote-e2e) y mide cuánto tarda su cambio en verse en esta pantalla. Inicia allí la superficie de prueba, conecta y ejecuta la prueba."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le test de latence clique sur la surface de test de l’ordinateur (spikes/remote-e2e) et mesure le temps que son changement met à apparaître sur cet écran. Lancez-y la surface de test, connectez-vous, puis exécutez le test."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Latenztest klickt auf die Testfläche am Computer (spikes/remote-e2e) und misst, wann deren Wechsel auf diesem Bildschirm erscheint. Dort die Testfläche starten, verbinden und dann den Test ausführen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
