    "While they are on, the Wi-Fi radio hops channels and can hold packets back for up to 90 ms. Turn off AirDrop (Control Center › AirDrop › No One) and Handoff (System Settings › General › AirDrop & Handoff) while streaming, or run `sudo ifconfig awdl0 down` until the next restart.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While they are on, the Wi-Fi radio hops channels and can hold packets back for up to 90 ms. Turn off AirDrop (Control Center › AirDrop › No One) and Handoff (System Settings › General › AirDrop & Handoff) while streaming, or run `sudo ifconfig awdl0 down` until the next restart."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While they are on, the Wi-Fi radio hops channels and can hold packets back for up to 90 ms. Turn off AirDrop (Control Centre › AirDrop › No One) and Handoff (System Settings › General › AirDrop & Handoff) while streaming, or run `sudo ifconfig awdl0 down` until the next restart."
          }
        },
        "en-AU": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While they are on, the Wi-Fi radio hops channels and can hold packets back for up to 90 ms. Turn off AirDrop (Control Centre › AirDrop › No One) and Handoff (System Settings › General › AirDrop & Handoff) while streaming, or run `sudo ifconfig awdl0 down` until the next restart."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它们开启时，Wi-Fi 无线电会切换信道，并可能让数据包延迟最多 90 毫秒。串流时请关闭 AirDrop（“控制中心”›“AirDrop”›“无人”）和 Handoff（“系统设置”›“通用”›“AirDrop 与 Handoff”），或运行 `sudo ifconfig awdl0 down`，直到下次重新启动。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它們開啟時，Wi-Fi 無線電會切換頻道，並可能讓封包延遲最多 90 毫秒。串流時請關閉 AirDrop（「控制中心」›「AirDrop」›「沒有人」）和 Handoff（「系統設定」›「一般」›「AirDrop 與 Handoff」），或執行 `sudo ifconfig awdl0 down`，直到下次重新啟動。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これらがオンの間、Wi-Fi の無線はチャンネルを切り替え、パケットを最大 90 ms 遅らせることがあります。ストリーミング中は AirDrop（コントロールセンター › AirDrop › 受信しない）と Handoff（システム設定 › 一般 › AirDropとHandoff）をオフにするか、次に再起動するまで `sudo ifconfig awdl0 down` を実行してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "켜져 있는 동안 Wi-Fi 무선 장치가 채널을 바꾸며 패킷을 최대 90 ms까지 지연시킬 수 있습니다. 스트리밍하는 동안에는 AirDrop(제어 센터 › AirDrop › 수신 안 함)과 Handoff(시스템 설정 › 일반 › AirDrop 및 Handoff)를 끄거나, 다음에 재시동할 때까지 `sudo ifconfig awdl0 down`을 실행하세요."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mientras están activados, la radio Wi-Fi salta de canal y puede retener paquetes hasta 90 ms. Desactiva AirDrop (Centro de Control › AirDrop › Nadie) y Handoff (Ajustes del Sistema › General › AirDrop y Handoff) mientras transmites, o ejecuta `sudo ifconfig awdl0 down` hasta el próximo reinicio."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lorsqu’ils sont activés, la radio Wi-Fi change de canal et peut retenir des paquets jusqu’à 90 ms. Désactivez AirDrop (Centre de contrôle › AirDrop › Personne) et Handoff (Réglages Système › Général › AirDrop et Handoff) pendant la diffusion, ou exécutez `sudo ifconfig awdl0 down` jusqu’au prochain redémarrage."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solange sie eingeschaltet sind, wechselt das WLAN-Funkmodul die Kanäle und kann Pakete bis zu 90 ms zurückhalten. AirDrop (Kontrollzentrum › AirDrop › Niemand) und Handoff (Systemeinstellungen › Allgemein › AirDrop & Handoff) während des Streamings ausschalten oder bis zum nächsten Neustart `sudo ifconfig awdl0 down` ausführen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
